00:06:20.023 --> 00:06:21.770
Like I really think the
money and happiness thing

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.300
is a very big confusion.

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:25.780
Most of my richest friends are miserable,

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:28.469
and some of my poorest
friends are super happy,

00:06:28.469 --> 00:06:29.960
so that's just one point.

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:32.200
But let's break it down, couple things.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.360
The biggest reason people
are unhappy right now

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.980
is 'cause they value
somebody else's opinion

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:38.250
more than they value their own.

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.790
That is the number-one blanket statement

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:42.270
that I've got for everybody.

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:44.600
Your mother's point of view on you,

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.525
your wife's point of view on you,

00:06:46.525 --> 00:06:49.130
your boyfriend's point of view,
your homie's point of view.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:51.590
Like, the reason I'm super happy is

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:53.530
nobody can tell me nothing.

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:56.820
My wife, mom and daughter can
walk into my room right now,

00:06:56.820 --> 00:07:00.460
tell me I'm a piece of crap,
and I would be 100% unfazed.

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:03.530
That is some gangster emotional structure.

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:05.430
And that's why I can never lose.

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:08.650
I know who I am and I'm just unfazed.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:11.540
So if my mom, daughter
and wife could come in

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:13.840
and tell me I'm a piece
of crap and I'm cool,

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:15.670
what do you think that troll on Instagram

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:17.720
that says I suck does?

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:19.040
Nothing.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.790
So, you need to figure out the following:

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:24.650
it is very likely that
either your mom or dad

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:27.720
screwed you up, they made you insecure,

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:29.050
they didn't love you enough,

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:32.020
they told you you weren't good
because they weren't good,

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:33.560
and misery loves company.

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:35.690
Once you face that demon,

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:37.930
once you cut out negativity

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:39.480
and the people that hold you down,

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.480
and you surround yourself with positivity,

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:44.430
and don't confuse delusion,
don't watch my videos

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.660
and rah-rah up and you
don't put any work in,

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:48.210
nothing good's going to happen.

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:49.940
You're just going to watch my videos.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.210
So don't get it confused,
but life is basic.

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:54.810
You're either on the optimism team

00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:56.730
or you're on the pessimism team,

00:07:56.730 --> 00:07:59.540
you're either on the offense
or you're on the defense.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.870
The reason people are unhappy is because,

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.520
let's talk about money and unhappiness.

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:07.310
Your three best friends
have a BMW and you don't.

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:08.750
You think it's that,

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:12.450
