00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:27.720
What do you think, some
immigrant's taking your job?

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:31.030
You suck, like if you think that, right?

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:33.230
You think somebody else
is taking your spot?

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:35.660
This is the world, we live in the richest,

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.060
